@startuml
skin rose
title Вариант 1: HTTP -> Backend -> SMTP (MailHog)

actor User as "Пользователь"
participant Client as "curl/Postman"
participant API as "Backend API\n/api/v1/mail/test"
participant SMTP as "MailHog SMTP\n:1025"
participant UI as "MailHog Web UI\n:8025"

User -> Client: Запускает POST /api/v1/mail/test
Client -> API: HTTP POST JSON (to, subject, body)

API -> API: Валидирует JSON
API -> SMTP: SMTP connect + send_message()
SMTP --> API: 250 OK (mail queued)

API --> Client: 200 OK + {message: mail queued}

User -> UI: Открывает UI MailHog
UI -> SMTP: Читает список писем
SMTP --> UI: Письмо доступно
UI --> User: Показывает письмо

@enduml